{
  "folder": "APQZ5fHFsMZFYLtD",
  "name": "Chaos Incarnate",
  "type": "feature",
  "_id": "7Ffc6gQvPYZQehI3",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/fear-fright-shadow-monster-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your mastery of elemental forces protects and emboldens you. If you are a berserker or reaver, you have immunity to acid, cold, corruption, fire, lightning, poison, and sonic damage equal to [[lookup 2*@M evaluate=true]]{twice your Might score}. If you are a stormwight, your damage immunity from your Primordial Storm feature increases to [[lookup 3*@M evaluate=true]]{three times your Might score}.</p><p>When any elemental or any other creature whose abilities deal acid, cold, corruption, fire, lightning, poison, or sonic damage first becomes aware of you in combat, if they have [[potency P strong]], they are [[/apply frightened save]].</p><p>Additionally, when you use Primordial Strike, you can spend up to 3 ferocity, [[/surge 1]]{gaining 1 surge} per ferocity spent to use for that strike.</p>",
      "director": "<p>This feature is an upgrade of the effects granted by the 7th level feature “Elemental Form.” You can increase the values of the effect you already have to match the values of this feature.</p>"
    },
    "source": {
      "book": "Heroes",
      "page": "142",
      "license": "Draw Steel Creator License"
    },
    "_dsid": "chaos-incarnate",
    "advancements": {}
  },
